{"asset_key":"ep7/gameplay_story_17600060","episode":"ep7","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"17600060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"narration:1:1760006001:0":{"text":"角笛が再び吹き鳴らされ、アグモンとブルータスが激突した。","source_cn":"随着号角再次响起，亚古兽和布鲁特斯碰撞在了一起","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA28F989543EECC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1760006002:0":{"text":"ブルータスは重厚な巨刃を振りかざし、鋭く的確な斬撃を繰り出す。","source_cn":"布鲁特斯挥舞着沉重的巨刃，凌厉而精准地劈砍","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4BC069E8646FFA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1760006003:0":{"text":"それに対しアグモンは、太一の指揮に合わせて機敏に身をかわし、ベビーフレイムを吐いて立ち向かった。","source_cn":"而亚古兽则在太一的指挥下，灵活地闪避、喷吐小型火焰","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D789D30FF229B69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1760006004:0":{"text":"苦しい戦いではあったが、それでもアグモンは踏ん張り続けた。","source_cn":"几个回合下来，尽管艰难，但亚古兽始终坚持着","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65D4E046370E82DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1760006005:0":{"text":"太一、アグモン……頑張れ！","source_cn":"太一、亚古兽……加油啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x481007D1FB232E3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1760006006:0":{"text":"あなたは、太一がずっと周囲の地形を観察していることに気づいた。まるで、何かを待っているようだ……","source_cn":"你注意到，太一始终在观察着周围的地势。他似乎在等待着什么……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x18E7D7E6F5DBA97C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あなたは、太一がずっと周囲の地形を観察していることに気づいた。まるで、何かを待っているようだ……","female":"あなたは、太一がずっと周囲の地形を観察していることに気づいた。まるで、何かを待っているようだ……","variant_male_record_index":"236714","variant_female_record_index":"236715","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1760006007:0":{"text":"今だ、アグモン！ユキダルモンと戦った時みたいに、丸まるんだ！","source_cn":"就是现在！亚古兽，就像对付雪人兽那样，卷成球状吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7793318E44F039E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1760006008:1":{"text":"俺たちのループシュートを見せてやる！","source_cn":"就让你见识一下，我们的S型射门神踢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x800A3873F1254095","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1760006009:1":{"text":"周囲が驚きに目を見張る中、太一は丸まったアグモンを思いきり空へ蹴り上げ、そのままブルータスを飛び越えさせた！","source_cn":"在众人惊讶的目光中，太一竟用力地将卷成球状的亚古兽踢向...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD34EBA6154C728A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1760006010:1":{"text":"次の瞬間、アグモンは体を伸ばしてブルータスの背にしっかりとつかまると、大きく口を開けた――","source_cn":"这时，亚古兽伸展身体，用力抓住了布鲁特斯的后背，张大嘴巴——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4F537DAFA78F397","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1760006011:0":{"text":"――ベビーフレイム！","source_cn":"——小型火焰！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C2F2D783B684D63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1760006012:0":{"text":"ブルータスは巨剣を背後へ振るい、アグモンを退けると同時に、炎を素早く払いのけた。","source_cn":"布鲁特斯将巨剑向后挥去，将亚古兽逼退的同时，快速将火焰扇去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF78452B6DD77C2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1760006013:0":{"text":"太一が続けてアグモンに指示を出そうとしたその時、不意に拍手が聞こえた。見ると、ブルータスは剣を下ろし、笑みを浮かべて拍手していた。","source_cn":"太一打算继续指挥亚古兽战斗时，却听到一阵掌声。布鲁特斯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39CFE7FC280828B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1760006014:0":{"text":"見事な奇策だ。アグモンの炎の威力がもっと強ければ、我は倒されていただろう。力はまだ未熟だが、伸びしろは十分ある。","source_cn":"出其不意的一招。只要亚古兽的火焰足够强大，我就会落败。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0457BA4CDAE3615","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1760006015:0":{"text":"見事だったぞ、アグモン、太一。お前たちの戦術勝ちだ。","source_cn":"干得漂亮，亚古兽、太一。你们的战术胜过了我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC844531E473D5EEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_